%% API Request Flow - user-facing request through the gateway
%% VERIFIED against api-gateway/src/app.ts, routes/proxy.routes.ts, middlewares/*.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant AM as authenticateServiceCaller
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant JWT as authenticateJwt
    participant P as http-proxy-middleware
    participant S as Downstream Service

    C->>G: GET /api/v1/marketing/companies<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token> or accessToken cookie
    G->>G: helmet() · cors() · requestId · logger · cookieParser
    G->>AM: x-service-name / x-service-secret present?
    AM-->>G: absent -> next()<br/>present -> timingSafeEqual check (403 on mismatch)
    G->>RL: globalRateLimiter (skips internal service callers)
    RL-->>G: next() / 429
    Note over G,RL: POST /api/v1/auth/{login,register,refresh-token}<br/>uses the tighter authRateLimiter
    G->>JWT: authenticateJwt (only when authRequired = true)
    JWT->>JWT: verifyAccessToken via remote JWKS<br/>RS256 + issuer + audience + type='access'
    JWT-->>G: req.headers['x-user-id'] = sub<br/>x-user-role, x-user-section, x-user-name,<br/>x-user-username, x-office-branch-id
    G->>P: mount on prefix /api/v1/marketing
    P->>P: strip inbound X-User-* and X-Service-*<br/>remove x-vercel-id
    P->>S: proxied request + x-gateway-secret<br/>+ re-injected X-User-* headers
    S->>S: verifyGatewaySecret -> authenticate (local JWKS)<br/>-> authorize / actor (re-check auth/me)
    S-->>P: response
    P-->>C: response
    Note over P,S: Proxy failure -> 503 Service Unavailable
